  "description": "AI Influencer Marketing Engine for DeepSeek Harness - Creator discovery, vetting, campaign orchestration, compliance checking, ROI forecasting, contract negotiation, crisis management, and community engagement for the $40B influencer marketing industry",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/types/index.d.ts",
